Comment: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,stuff
Comment: 1,0:07:16.41,0:07:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 1,0:10:28.85,0:10:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 1,0:10:32.86,0:10:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 1,0:16:18.12,0:16:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 1,0:17:58.18,0:18:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 1,0:19:12.50,0:19:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 1,0:20:49.52,0:20:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.01,0:00:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fallen leaves again?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.61,0:00:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's going to be a lot of trouble cleaning them up tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.12,0:00:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's in a lot of trouble too, isn't she.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.76,0:00:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.80,0:00:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There isn't anything I can do, is there?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.77,0:00:43.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Kobato!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.58,0:00:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.28,0:00:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.93,0:00:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you all go out together?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.98,0:00:54.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Their school held a bazaar.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.05,0:00:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A bazaar?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.52,0:00:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone brings stuff to sell!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.67,0:01:01.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then the school uses the money!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.13,0:01:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's it!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.59,0:02:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A bazaar!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.96,0:02:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka, let's have a bazaar!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.03,0:02:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That way we can sell enough to pay off the loan shark!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.07,0:02:55.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.48,0:03:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we pay him back, then we won't be evicted!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.82,0:03:06.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right? So let's have a bazaar!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.78,0:03:08.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, that's...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.95,0:03:12.00,Default-kobaalt,,0000,0000,0000,,If we could pay him off that easily, we already would've.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.72,0:03:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.13,0:03:22.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'd work better at a big school. At a nursery with only a few kids, we'd hardly make anything.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.03,0:03:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's pointless.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.58,0:03:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I got so excited about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.67,0:03:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go sweep up outside now.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.13,0:03:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's so excited that it'll hurt her the most if it fails.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.03,0:04:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I know why you wanted to talk her out of it, but that's not the way to say so.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.21,0:04:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you're too blunt, she'll just think you're being mean.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.26,0:04:26.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.54,0:04:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got carried away.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.91,0:04:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto and Miss Sayaka have already given up...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.91,0:04:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so stupid...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.92,0:04:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you {\i1}are{\i0} stupid...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.92,0:04:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But that enthusiasm isn't a bad thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.80,0:05:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.47,0:05:05.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit squeezing me!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.57,0:05:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.01,0:05:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.98,0:05:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's have a bazaar!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.25,0:05:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A bazaar?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.39,0:05:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's where you bring things from home that you made or you don't need anymore, and we sell them here.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.09,0:05:30.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We get to play shopkeeper!?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.84,0:05:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna sell yakisoba!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.70,0:05:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a nice idea.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.70,0:05:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wrote the details on your notes home.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.64,0:05:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be sure to show your families.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.33,0:05:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.51,0:05:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's try our best!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.51,0:05:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.38,0:05:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you happy Kobato's cheered up?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.71,0:05:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.08,0:05:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.27,0:05:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you tomorrow, Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.51,0:06:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.39,0:06:04.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bazaar!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.87,0:06:10.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.02,0:06:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a doggie!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.45,0:06:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How about that one?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.24,0:06:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A kitty!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.54,0:06:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you think that's pretty insulting to actual dogs and cats?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.01,0:06:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's right, there's no arguing with that.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.95,0:06:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good work, you two.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.46,0:06:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.39,0:06:36.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, did you draw this?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.44,0:06:37.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.00,0:06:39.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's pretty good.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.40,0:06:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.35,0:06:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a cute duck and sheep.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.24,0:06:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mind if I go ahead?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.14,0:06:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have work?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.24,0:06:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.38,0:06:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't overwork yourself.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.95,0:06:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.58,0:07:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't overwork yourself, either.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.79,0:07:11.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto... Smiling and laughing like that...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.61,0:07:25.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.91,0:07:29.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's so childish sometimes...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.75,0:07:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's really into you, Kobato.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.72,0:07:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's just like him. Neither are very up-front.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.06,0:07:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Him"?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.79,0:07:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good work today, Kobato.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.00,0:07:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's finish preparing for the bazaar tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.71,0:08:00.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Him"?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.38,0:08:04.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did she mean her husband?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.55,0:08:10.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That's right, you used to order for your husband's birthday.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.99,0:08:12.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Yeah...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.46,0:08:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.60,0:08:22.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who was she talking about not being honest with himself?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:22.73,0:08:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.10,0:08:25.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a mystery.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:25.35,0:08:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not as mysterious as your drawings.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.37,0:08:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're terrible!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.31,0:08:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, everyone!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.32,0:08:44.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's this?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:44.62,0:08:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a teru-teru bouzu!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.54,0:08:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Teru-teru bouzu?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.11,0:08:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They make it sunny out!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.80,0:08:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who brought those?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.83,0:08:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Naomi, you made them?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.34,0:09:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My teru-teru bouzu make it sunny when you're going on a trip, or to the pool!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.65,0:09:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, they're great!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.32,0:09:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I hope they'll sell...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.07,0:09:17.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course! I'll make something too.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:17.82,0:09:19.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's sell ours next to each other.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.29,0:09:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's put price tags on everything you brought.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.76,0:09:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.86,0:09:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, write neatly.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.60,0:09:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.70,0:09:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:33.04,0:09:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we sell a lot of teru-teru bouzu, can the nursery stay here?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:37.79,0:09:39.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course, it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.88,0:09:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.08,0:09:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My mommy's gonna have a baby soon.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.22,0:09:49.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really!?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:49.04,0:09:50.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.64,0:09:51.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.89,0:09:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mom's taking time off work now...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.33,0:10:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When the baby gets a little bigger, she'll go back.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.73,0:10:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And she already knows she wants to send it to Yomogi!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.70,0:10:10.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be the big sister coming by every afternoon!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.94,0:10:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll still see you and Miss Sayaka every day!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.91,0:10:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to see you every day, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.65,0:10:22.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's try our best, everyone!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.09,0:10:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.52,0:11:01.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, it's pretty late.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.19,0:11:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You work at Yomogi Nursery?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.46,0:11:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.66,0:11:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That voice... You're the girl I talked to on the phone.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.44,0:11:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.31,0:11:22.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The loan shark.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.67,0:11:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm shutting down the nursery.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.60,0:11:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm not giving her any longer.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.07,0:11:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're the guy...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.41,0:11:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You working overtime?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.51,0:11:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.68,0:11:58.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just took a while finishing the posters for the bazaar{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.15,0:12:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a bad person! I didn't say that!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.57,0:12:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're a funny one.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.72,0:12:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought so when we talked on the phone, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.53,0:12:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you talk to Sayaka?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.83,0:12:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,About how I'm not giving her any longer...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.96,0:12:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tell her I came here today, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.77,0:12:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And that as soon as time's up, she's getting shut down.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.94,0:12:28.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's horrible!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.48,0:12:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care if there's kids around.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.15,0:12:35.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't want someone to get hurt, you'd better clear out.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.52,0:12:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you later, Kobato.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.07,0:12:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's shutting the nursery down...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.34,0:12:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is he serious?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.72,0:13:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's terrible, not caring if there's kids around.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.95,0:13:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For someone with such a kind face, that man is scary.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.52,0:13:15.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That man? Who?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.19,0:13:18.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto! You were listening!?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.16,0:13:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just overheard. You talk to yourself pretty loud.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.67,0:13:23.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't talking to my{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.07,0:13:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, which guy?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.54,0:13:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He seemed like he was grinning...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.91,0:13:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And he just called Miss Sayaka by her name...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:40.28,0:13:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura!?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.99,0:13:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know him?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.66,0:13:50.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did Miss Sayaka meet him?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.36,0:13:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.73,0:13:56.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He talked with me, and then he left.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.60,0:14:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell Miss Sayaka he was there.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:03.14,0:14:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.68,0:14:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just keep it quiet.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.59,0:14:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What did you go there for?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.49,0:14:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't let you make Sayaka cry any more.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.29,0:14:25.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Never show your face around her, got it!?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.10,0:14:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That man...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.94,0:14:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's named Okiura, huh.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.37,0:14:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder how he knows Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.32,0:14:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it obvious!?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.15,0:14:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka's married, and they have the same last name.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.18,0:14:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And he just calls her Sayaka.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.29,0:14:56.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then that's her husband!?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.33,0:15:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then why does he want to shut down the nursery?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.87,0:15:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't stick your neck out on this one, kid.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:10.64,0:15:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, isn't there something you have to do?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.14,0:15:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't fill that bottle, you can't go where you want to.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:22.22,0:15:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm worried.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.36,0:15:37.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And? What have you been sewing?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.66,0:15:39.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A mascot!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:39.35,0:15:42.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm making them from the cloth Chitose gave me.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.08,0:15:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, a penguin?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.21,0:15:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a bunny...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:53.58,0:15:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You call those ears!?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.09,0:15:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever! It doesn't matter if it's a penguin!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.52,0:16:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna try my best to make the bazaar a success!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.29,0:16:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you're doing this by mass-producing those unidentified objects!?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.50,0:16:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're acting like Fujimoto again! You're horrible!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.54,0:16:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's gotten pretty cloudy.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.21,0:16:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.38,0:16:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure it will clear up.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.95,0:16:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That'd be nice.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.59,0:16:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.76,0:16:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna go get something that's sure to sell.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.46,0:16:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.87,0:16:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's try our best today!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.62,0:16:47.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.14,0:16:54.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just know your teru-teru bouzu will make it sunny.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.75,0:17:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't trip, Kobato!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.50,0:17:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Remember, you're carrying drinks.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.65,0:17:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.77,0:17:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know you're gonna.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:04.96,0:17:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I will not trip!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.49,0:17:10.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You two really do get along well.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.39,0:17:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.71,0:17:12.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At all!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.83,0:17:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto brought these in from work.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.85,0:17:31.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.15,0:17:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew you were gonna trip.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:35.12,0:17:36.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.39,0:17:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be so careless.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.67,0:17:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've gotta hurry!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.94,0:17:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew you'd trip, Kobato.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:16.90,0:18:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No one's coming...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.28,0:18:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even though we all put up posters...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.40,0:18:26.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay. I know your moms are a little late,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.47,0:18:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but I'm sure other people will turn up.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.97,0:18:31.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.51,0:18:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think anyone's going to come.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:50.93,0:18:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm the one who wanted to have a bazaar...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.84,0:19:02.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.17,0:19:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.81,0:19:09.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We've been looking forward to this since Kobato told us about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.33,0:19:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.86,0:19:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.36,0:19:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.50,0:19:14.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like some yakisoba?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.46,0:19:16.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We have iced coffee, too!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.14,0:19:17.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And we can make café au lait.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.72,0:19:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.89,0:19:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I really was looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.16,0:19:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chiho and Chise were too.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.58,0:19:25.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, you know...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.33,0:19:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When I didn't see any posters up today, I thought it was canceled.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.19,0:19:35.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That couldn't{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.77,0:19:38.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me he did it?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.68,0:19:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.85,0:19:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to go tell everyone the bazaar isn't canceled!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.35,0:19:48.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it a bit late for that?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.83,0:19:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not too late!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.72,0:19:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe they'll still come!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.33,0:19:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you do, we don't have enough to{\fscx162}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:55.59,0:19:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I want to get a lot of people here!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.91,0:20:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After all, everyone worked so hard!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.70,0:20:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We all worked together!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.94,0:20:07.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.40,0:20:09.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You did too, Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.22,0:20:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato's such a good girl.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.32,0:20:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:28.46,0:20:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.76,0:20:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're calling for me. I'd better go prepare the coffee.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:35.13,0:20:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's not really up-front, but he's a good boy.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.10,0:20:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.78,0:20:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A chicken?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.38,0:20:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,An ocean sunfish?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.81,0:20:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No one's coming.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.60,0:20:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even though the rain stopped...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:53.45,0:20:55.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even though it's sunny now...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.55,0:20:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:00.39,0:21:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this where the bazaar is?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:04.29,0:21:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.03,0:21:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato came and told me all about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.27,0:21:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So I came to take a look.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:12.40,0:21:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, it's here?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.94,0:21:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're having a bazaar?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.87,0:21:19.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what you're selling?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.55,0:21:20.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks fun!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.71,0:21:21.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where do we start?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.21,0:21:23.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.42,0:21:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like it's a success.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.89,0:21:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.43,0:21:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato told me about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.16,0:21:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's Kobato? Isn't she back yet?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.04,0:21:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,One iced coffee, please.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.87,0:21:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay! Mister Kiyokazu, one iced coffee!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.71,0:21:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.31,0:22:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This energetic girl walked by yelling about a bazaar at Yomogi Nursery.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.05,0:22:03.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She seemed so enthusiastic.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.63,0:22:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I said I'd check it out later, but then she grabbed me by the hands and dragged me here.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.54,0:22:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.20,0:22:16.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She really stuck out, huh. It's just like her.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.67,0:22:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.75,0:22:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Naomi! Sorry I'm late!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.57,0:22:26.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A lot of people are at your bazaar.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.24,0:22:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.18,0:22:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a good thing the weather cleared up.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.62,0:22:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.73,0:22:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a bazaar at Yomogi Nursery!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.36,0:22:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone! Be sure to come by!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.84,0:22:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a bazaar at Yomogi Nursery!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.94,0:22:57.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be sure to come by!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.26,0:01:16.13,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.13,0:01:24.43,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.43,0:01:34.23,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 1,0:01:35.74,0:01:40.03,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.03,0:01:47.79,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.79,0:01:53.46,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.46,0:01:58.68,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.68,0:02:04.97,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.97,0:02:10.65,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.65,0:02:17.36,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.36,0:02:26.08,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.84,0:02:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,1125)\pos(360,166)\c&HFFFFFF&}... Mysterious Life-form.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.94,0:23:08.11,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{14 into ED}People all want to fly
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.78,0:23:15.62,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.20,0:23:23.63,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.21,0:23:32.26,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 1,0:23:33.60,0:23:43.27,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 1,0:23:43.65,0:23:45.98,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:46.53,0:23:54.41,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell me "thanks", if you say "thanks" and smile
Dialogue: 1,0:23:54.41,0:24:01.50,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Going back and forth, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 1,0:24:02.29,0:24:11.01,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 1,0:24:11.09,0:24:15.18,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 1,0:24:16.89,0:24:28.32,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 1,0:24:25.31,0:24:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(458,388)}... Mysterious Life-form, #2.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:25.31,0:24:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(456,116)}Next episode
